# boss-wave.vrs: revenge D32 (design §9 D51). bw-test (Admin location, waveList: 3 CHAR_Spider_Forest, then 3 more when
# cleared, bosses CHAR_Spider_Queen_VBlood count 1 at level 40) spawns no boss in wave 1; wave 2 spawns the spiders and
# Ungoro; killing them all ends "all waves defeated (2 of 2 waves)" with no VBloodKilled for the tracked boss (D30).
# Ungoro's own summons (CHAR_Spiderling_Summon -18289884) belong to the game and end within 120 s (Review 5 F1).
# Needs: NyarDevTools (.devgo, .devkill, .devunits); bw-test in events.json; rv-test, rv-test0 and every FactionKills
# definition disabled (Review 4 F1); no purge cooldown. Wrap the world in dev-snapshot (Chaos may gain the V Blood).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 3
mark
chat .nyar event start bw-test
expect-log event bw-test started by
expect-log event bw-test wave 1/2: 3 units queued timeout=30
expect-no-log spawned CHAR_Spider_Queen_VBlood timeout=8
wait 4
chat .devkill -581295882 40
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=3
expect-log event bw-test wave 1 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event bw-test wave 2/2: 4 units queued timeout=30
expect-log spawned CHAR_Spider_Queen_VBlood for bw-test timeout=20
wait 5
mark
chat .devkill -548489519 60
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=1
expect-no-log trigger: VBloodKilled timeout=8
chat .devkill -581295882 60
expect-log event bw-test ended: all waves defeated \(2 of 2 waves\) timeout=30
wait 125
mark
chat .devunits -18289884 80
expect-log \[DEV UNITS\] n=0
